Package: mapnhanespa
Title: Map Quantiles for Physical Activity from 'NHANES' 
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    c(
    person(given = "John",
           family = "Muschelli",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "muschellij2@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6469-1750")),
    person(given = "Lily",
           family = "Koffman",
           role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1543-2896"))
    )
Description: Maps physical activity from the National Health and Nutrition 
    Examination Survey ('NHANES') study into population-based quantiles,
    using the NHANES 2011-2014 step count and physical activity summaries
    described in Koffman, Crainiceanu, and Muschelli (2025)
    <doi:10.1249/MSS.0000000000003616>, with minute-level data from
    Koffman and Muschelli (2025) <doi:10.13026/9n0r-tv02>.
